  <iati-identifier>GB-GOV-1-301223-101</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localised approach through national civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to remove barriers to reintegration of IDPs back to their areas of return through addressing social cohesion issues, legal barriers and barriers relating to livelihoods and employment opportunities. The project also aims to influence and build capacity of the Govt of Iraq to ensure policies are facilitating the sustainable return and reintegration of IDPs in Iraq. The project consortium consists of multiple local NGOs who deliver through their strong relationships and contextual knowledge of Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
